# Per-video provenance records land here as JSON files (one per video).
#
# Each record captures: topic + trend signal, script provenance (manual/AI-drafted/AI-edited),
# every stock asset used (source + ID + URL + license text at download time), music track,
# whether the AI-disclosure flag was set on upload, and the human-approval timestamp.
#
# Gitignored — these may contain decisions/timestamps you'd rather keep local.
